There is a kaali-peeli taxi in front.
I put my luggage in the taxi.
I look at the driver.
I say, "Namaste bhaiya."
He says, "Namaste madam."
My mobile phone is in my hand.
My new address is on the phone.
I show the phone to bhaiya.
He reads the address and nods.
He says, "Okay madam."
I sit in the taxi.
Bhaiya starts the taxi.
On the way, he asks a question.
He asks, "Madam, are you a tourist?"
I say, "No bhaiya, I am not a tourist."
"I am a software engineer."
"My work is in Mumbai."
He smiles and says, "Welcome to Mumbai."
I say, "Thank you bhaiya."
Outside the window, the city is very big.
